#ASSERT `3.2: what the text says of a private damages claim` `wholly foreign conduct` (LIST `an import effect not yet found substantial, causing the injury`) `private` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `3.2: what the text says of a private damages claim` `foreign conduct found to involve import commerce` (LIST `an import effect failing the three requirements, yet causing the injury`) `private` EQUALS JUST `the plaintiff may recover damages for that injury`

