    `the involvement` IS involvement
    `as a result of its payment or financing, the U.S. government bears a substantial portion of the cost of the transaction` IS substantial
    `the effect of the conduct with respect to the sale of the goods or services falls primarily on U.S. taxpayers` IS taxpayers

