§§ `4.1 Comity`

`no comity facts` MEANS `Comity facts (4.1)` WITH
    `significant interests of a foreign sovereign would be affected` IS FALSE
    `there is a purpose to affect, or an actual effect on, U.S. commerce` IS FALSE
    `the effects of the conduct on the United States are significant and foreseeable` IS FALSE
    `enforcement would conflict with a foreign jurisdiction's law or articulated policy` IS FALSE
    `the enforcement activities of another jurisdiction, including their remedies, may be affected` IS FALSE
    `the objectives sought by U.S. enforcement could be achieved by foreign enforcement` IS FALSE
    `a foreign sovereign encourages or discourages the course of conduct, or leaves parties free to choose among courses of conduct` IS FALSE

`every comity fact` MEANS `Comity facts (4.1)` WITH
    `significant interests of a foreign sovereign would be affected` IS TRUE
    `there is a purpose to affect, or an actual effect on, U.S. commerce` IS TRUE
    `the effects of the conduct on the United States are significant and foreseeable` IS TRUE
    `enforcement would conflict with a foreign jurisdiction's law or articulated policy` IS TRUE
    `the enforcement activities of another jurisdiction, including their remedies, may be affected` IS TRUE
    `the objectives sought by U.S. enforcement could be achieved by foreign enforcement` IS TRUE
    `a foreign sovereign encourages or discourages the course of conduct, or leaves parties free to choose among courses of conduct` IS TRUE

`a conflict and another jurisdiction's enforcement` MEANS `Comity facts (4.1)` WITH
    `significant interests of a foreign sovereign would be affected` IS FALSE
    `there is a purpose to affect, or an actual effect on, U.S. commerce` IS FALSE
    `the effects of the conduct on the United States are significant and foreseeable` IS FALSE
    `enforcement would conflict with a foreign jurisdiction's law or articulated policy` IS TRUE
    `the enforcement activities of another jurisdiction, including their remedies, may be affected` IS TRUE
    `the objectives sought by U.S. enforcement could be achieved by foreign enforcement` IS FALSE
    `a foreign sovereign encourages or discourages the course of conduct, or leaves parties free to choose among courses of conduct` IS FALSE

