#ASSERT `4.1: whether a conflict of law exists` (`foreign law: compliance with both possible` FALSE `, neutral` FALSE `, only a blocking statute` TRUE) EQUALS JUST `the agencies do not view the mere existence of a blocking statute as creating a conflict of law for purposes of the comity analysis`
